*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# The Steamworks library is not ours to redistribute. The relay needs
# steam_api64.dll (64-bit) or steam_api.dll (32-bit) next to it, plus
# steam_appid.txt = 480 - see tools/steamlink/README.md for where to get them and the
# SHA-256 they must have.
steam_api*.dll
steam_appid.txt
